s terrible. After 999 mil we speak of millions) [\/f-blue][sline][f-red]gente[\/f-red][\/sline] [f-blue]personas viajan en metro [\/f-blue]cada d[f-red]í[\/f-red]a, [f-blue]que [\/f-blue]es más que [sline]la cantidad[\/sline] [sline][f-red]de[\/f-red][\/sline] [f-blue]en [\/f-blue]otras cuidades de los EE."],[],["Ad[f-blue]e[\/f-blue]más, [sline][f-red]se tiene[\/f-red][\/sline] [f-blue]hay [\/f-blue]5900 autob[f-red]u[\/f-red]s[f-red]es[\/f-red] , las mayor[f-red]í[\/f-red]a de ellos [sline][f-red]se operan[\/f-red][\/sline] [f-blue]funcionando las 24 horas del día, [\/f-blue]cada dia de[f-blue]l[\/f-blue] [sline][f-red]365[\/f-red][\/sline] [f-blue]año [\/f-blue][sline][f-red]y cada hora de 24 horas[\/f-red][\/sline]."]
