"Mi nuevo carro y otras cosas!!
Hola todas!
Ayer me madre y yo buscamos por mi un nuevo carro.
Por 6 anos, pasé por 3 carros y me reciente será dado a mi hermano menor.
No me gusta mucho coches grandes por que beben mucha gasolina.
:\/ Quiero un Nissan Maxima porque ellos confiable y duran mucho tiempo.
Último fin de semana, finalmente se graduó de la universidad!!
No mas escuela por mi!!!
:D Tengo un título en la radio, la televisión y el cine.
Soy muy contento!!
(English)
Hey everybody!
Yesterday my mom and I went to look for a new car.
For six years, I went through three cars and the current one I have will be passed down to my little brother.
Truthfully, I do not like big cars all that much anymore cause they drink a LOT of gas!
Right now, i'm looking at getting a Nissan Maxima.
I love Maximas and they're very dependable and they last a good while.
I should also note that I FINALLY FINISHED COLLEGE!!!
Last weekend, I graduated with a Bachlors of Arts in Radio, Television, and Film!
I am very happy and I can't wait to see what God has in store for me in the future.
:) 
Peace and love!
Maury V."],[[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[]
