Ellos son españoles.
Ramón es ingeniero.
Él es muy importante en su trabajo porque habla inglés y español.
Mercedes es profesora de español en un colegio de la cuidad.
\tLos hermanos de Enrique son alumnos en una escuela primaria.
Ellos hablan inglés y español como Enrique.
En casa, la familia de Enrique habla español.
Inglés
\tThe Pereda family is very large and lives in a large enough house.
Enrique has 2 brothers and 2 sisters.
In Enrique's house lives his father, his mother, his 4 siblings (4 brothers and sisters) and him.
His father is called Ramon and his mother is called Mercedes.
They are spanish.
Ramon is an engineer.
He is very important in his job because he speaks english and spanish.
Mercedes is a spanish instructor in a private school of the city.
\tEnrique's siblings (2 brothers and 2 sisters) are students in an elementary school.
They speak english and spanish like Enrique.
At home, Enrique's family speaks spanish.
