"Lyrics
A dear friend here on Lang-8 has recommended me some Spanish songs to learn more vocabulary from them.
One of which sounded very beautiful with the type of music I like -- quiet music but not so slow make me sleep --.
I need help with the song's lyrics and translation.
I got them from Yahoo Answers, apparently the poster was a native Spanish speaker.
I just want to make sure that he\/she got it right.
Honestly, I don't feel like I fully understand it even with the translation. Here is the song.
http:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=1qMPJ8ltyrk&feature=player_embedded
-----------------------LYRICS & TRANSLATION---------------------------------------
A GRITOS DE ESPERANZA
E: (With shouts of hope) or something like that lol.
A pesar, que la luna, no brille, mañana, 
Dará igual, sólo verte reír, 
Es lo que me hace feliz, mi alma.
E: (If the moon doesn’t shine tomorrow,
It will be the same, only seeing you laugh,
It’s what makes me happy, my soul.) 
*”my soul” is her, like saying, you are my life, he is saying you are my soul in that part*
Y es verdad, que una mirada distinta, 
O algún gesto más frío, se clava, 
En mi pecho, daga del desconcierto, 
Pero amor, ahí está la magia.
E: (And it’s true that a different look,
Or a colder gesture, stabs,
In my chest, disagreement’s dagger,
But my love, there is the magic.)
Ahora que te veo niña ya te hecho de menos, 
No imagino mis heridas si algún día te vas lejos, 
Querría, por esto.
E: (Now that I see you girl, I already miss you,
I don’t imagine my wounds if someday you leave (far),
I would want, for this,…)
Si preguntan por mí, 
No les digas dónde fui, 
Q tu alma sea fuerte y cuando mires hacia el frente, 
No recuerdes todo lo que no te di.
*E: (If they ask about me,
Don’t tell them where did I go,
That your soul is strong and when you see forward,
Don’t remember all what I didn’t give you.)
Y es que quedan tantas cosas por contarte y que me cuentes 
Tantos ratos y pasiones por vivir, 
A tu lado, oh mi vida, a tu lado.
**E: (And there are still too many things to tell you and you to tell me (to talk)
So many \"short whiles\" and passions to live,
By your side, oh my life, by your side.)
Y ojalá, que nuestros ojos, sí brillen, mañana, 
Q tu voz siga pidiéndome a gritos amor, 
A gritos de esperanza.
E: (And I hope, that our eyes, shine, tomorrow,
That your voice keeps asking with shouts for love,
With shouts of hope.)
Ahora que te tengo no pienso perder el tiempo, 
Ni perderme por mi absurdo ego ni un solo momento, 
Se esfuma, el miedo.
E: (Now that I have you, I don’t want to waste the time,
Or get lost for my absurd ego nor a single moment,
The fear disappears.)
Si preguntan por mí, 
No les digas dónde fui, 
Q tu alma sea fuerte y cuando mires hacia el frente, 
No recuerdes todo lo que no te di.
(*chorus)
Qué tu luz brille por siempre porque tú te lo mereces, 
Y perdona si algún día pretendí, 
Q no fueras, oh tú misma.
E: (That your light shines forever because you deserve it,
And forgive me if someday I tried
That you were not yourself.)
Si preguntan por ti, 
Sólo diré que te vi, en mis sueños una noche, 
Y sólo sueño desde entonces para verme cada día junto a ti.
E: (If they ask about you,
I will only say that I saw you in my dreams one night,
And I only dream since then to can see myself everyday by your side, (with you).)
Es que quedan tantas cosas por contarte y que me cuentes, 
Tantos ratos y pasiones por vivir, 
A tu lado, oh mi vida, a tu lado.
