I need to study a lot.
In high school I had 2 years of Spanish, so Spanish 10 was only review.
It is 3:30 in the morning and I can't sleep.
My first class is at 1:25 in the afternoon.
I have time to sleep.
This is practice for my essay in class today.
Hay muchas formas de verbos en Español.
Más de English por mucho.
La forma de preterito tiene muchas excepciones y es muy confuso para mi.
La forma de imperfecto es un poco más facíl.
Nosotros aprendemos la forma de command ayer.
El más difícil parte de command es recordando que verbos son reflexivos.
There are many forms of verbs in Spanish.
More than English by a lot.
The preterit form form had many exceptions and is confusing to me.
The imperfect form is a little easier.
We learned the command for yesterday.
The hardest part of command form is remembering which verbs are reflexive.
Peus, ahora el tiempo esta un cuarto de cuatro.
