"entry #4
I like the United States better because we do many things that the Spanish speaking countries dont do.
We also have the right amount of school time,Spanish speaking countries start school too early.
Some teachers give lectures to us,but on the other hand we also do hands on activities with the other students in the class.
We call the teachers Mr.\/Mrs with their last name.
We also have many extra curricular activities.
In some USA schools we have to wear uniforms."],[[],[],[],[],[],[],[]
