un poco de asucar, de sol [f-red](sel?)[\/f-red]"],[],["dos o tres [f-blue]cucharadas[\/f-blue] de harina de trigo [f-bold][When you use \"spoon\" as a measure, you use \"[f-blue]cucharada[\/f-blue]\"... like [f-blue]spoonful[\/f-blue], I think][\/f-bold]"],["[f-blue]Pon[\/f-blue] el reques[f-blue]ó[\/f-blue]n en [f-blue]la[\/f-blue] sopera, a[f-blue]ñ[\/f-blue]ade dos huevos y azúcar, [f-blue]mezclalos[\/f-blue] , a[f-blue]ñ[\/f-blue]ade un poco de sol [f-blue][?][\/f-blue] y leche[f-bold][f-blue],[\/f-blue][\/f-bold] bate con [f-blue]tenedor[\/f-blue] o en la batidora.
