"Prequnta
Today, I did some Spanish quizes on internet and I couldn't give some correct answers.
However, this quize didn't tell me right answer when I mistook them.
It said \"you are right\" when I had the correct answer.
It's strange!!
Please tell me the following answers.
I think they are begginer and quite easy.(but I can't)
The quizes are about \"ser\".
1)De donde (  ) usted?
- (  ) de Mexico.
My answer were= De donde (es) usted?
- (Somos) de Mexico.
2)De donde (  )?
- (  ) de Jaon.
My answer were= De donde (es)?
- (Es) de Jaon."],[[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],["My answer were= ¿De dónde (es) usted? [f-blue][f-bold]That's right![\/f-bold][\/f-blue]"],["- ([f-blue][f-bold]Soy[\/f-bold][\/f-blue]) de Mexico. (\"Usted\" = You...\"Somos\" it's a plural form and it means \"We\")
- [f-red][f-bold]Soy[\/f-bold][\/f-red] de Mexico. [f-blue](Soy=Yo (I am). Somos=Nosotros (We are))[\/f-blue]"],["2) ¿De dónde [f-red][f-bold]eres[\/f-bold][\/f-red]? [f-blue](Tú eres = You are (singular))[\/f-blue]"],["- [f-red][f-bold]Soy[\/f-bold][\/f-red] de Ja[f-red][f-bold]pó[\/f-bold][\/f-red]n."],[],[]
