"Unit 5 E.Q
If I went to a Spanish speaking school and I had to speak Spanish all day, I’d think it would be hard for me because I have to take a while to form my sentences and people would thing I was some sort of special child because it takes me so long to respond to them.
But I think it  is similar  because  everyone is speaking the same language as their basic one.
And as it is similar, it is very different in ways like the way the school is ran or how authority works."],[[],[],[],[]
