"Epiktetus !!!
Today　I went to a residence I used to stay at and ate supper at the cafeteria.
It’s been 5 months since I went there last.
It was delicious partly because I hadn’t eaten anything today.
Instead of going to the cafeteria , I’ve been cooking for myself.
Today is about to end but I want to savour it.
While I stay in Spain, I’ve read many times one of books of Epiktetus.
Even now I carry it with me.
Wherever I go, whenever it is (even when I’m on the bed) I have it with me.
I don’t know how many times I’ve read this book, actually I remember not only the contents but also some important phrases.
In the near future I want to read the original written in ancient Greek.
Also I want to read the originals of Seneca in Latin.
So I’ve got to learn both languages."],[[],[],[],[],[],[],["While I stay in Spain, I’ve read many times one of the books of Epiktetus."],[],[],[],[],[],[]
