"\"Ensayo 3A\" 
My Spanish teacher gave us an essay to write.
It only has to be about a paragraph long.
I decided to post a rough draft of it here.
To see if I can make it any better.
Keep in mind, I can't use very much that we haven't learned in the class.
The essay is used as a practice and review for preterit form.
Here is the topic:
\"Describe what you did last Saturday or Sunday.
What time did you get up?
Where did you go?
With whom did you go?
What did you do at each place?
What time did you arrive home?
What did you do after you arrived home?
What time did you go to bed?\"
And here is the rough draft I wrote, I know it's pretty short.
~>~>~>~><~<~<~<~
Me desperté a las nueve de la mañana.
Mi amiga y yo fuimos al cine para ver una pelicula interesante.
Despues de la pelicula, fuimos al restaurante para comer.
Ella comió una ensalada de frutas y yo comí una hambergesa con queso.
Luego fuimos a su casa a las cinco y media.
Vimos la tele para cuatro horas.
Nos acostamos a las once de la noche.
~>~>~>~><~<~<~<~
Please correct any mistakes you see and let me know how I can make it better.
Thank you ^_^
P.
S.
Is 'ensayo' the right word for 'essay'?
That is the word my assignment uses, but my dictionary translates it as 'rehersal'."],[[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],["Mi amiga y yo fuimos al cine para ver una pel[f-red]í[\/f-red]cula interesante.
