However in the city there is much pollution, I think that mexico has less pollution.
So although England is old, historic and peaceful, Visit a city in England for example (London, Birmingham, Bristol, Manchester and Wales) it's noisy and dirty but modern and important throughout peoples lifes.
Mexico is close to the carribean islands, north of america and south american countrys.
Mexico is famous for peaceful golden beaches in the sun and in the future I would like to visit different beaches and try hot food!
In my opinion Mexico is much better than England because the food is much hotter and interesting compared to England and I love hot food!
Although, I live in Bristol - I have seen photos of Mexico y it seems beautiful however if you like a country with alot of films and soaps on television for example ( eastenders, coronation street, hollyoaks and big brother ) Come to England!"],[[],["Es[f-red] I[\/f-red]nglatera realmente mejor que [f-red]M[\/f-red]exico?"],[],["[f-red]Pensandolo nuevamente[\/f-red]!"],["Por favor, Voy a explicar brevemete por que  bell[f-red]elo[\/f-red] centro de America es mejor que Inglatera."],["Mexico es un pa[f-red]í[\/f-red]s en el centro de America[f-red],[\/f-red] [f-red]en [\/f-red]comparaci[f-red]ó[\/f-red]n [f-red]con [\/f-red]Inglatera [f-red]que [\/f-red]es[f-red]ta[\/f-red] situado en Europ[f-red]a.[\/f-red] [f-red]El clima de [\/f-red]Mexico es mucho mas [f-red]caluroso [\/f-red]que [f-red]el de[\/f-red] Inglatera ..."],["En mi opini[f-red]ó[\/f-red]n [f-red]el clima calido [\/f-red]es mejor que un [f-blue]país donde no hay sol![\/f-blue]"],["Inglatera es un pa[f-red]í[\/f-red]s con bell[f-red]os[\/f-red] paisajes y edificos historico[f-red]s[\/f-red], Inglatera en general es muy verde[f-red], [\/f-red][sline]en [\/sline]la ciudad sin embargo [f-red]tiene [\/f-red][sline]un[\/sline] mucho [f-red]más [\/f-red]contaminaci[f-red]ó[\/f-red]n [f-red]que [\/f-red]Mexico , [sline]por lo que [\/sline]aunque Inglatera es antigua,[f-blue] tiene mucha historia[\/f-blue] y [f-blue]es[\/f-blue] tranquila, vivir en una ciudad de Inglatera (Londres,Bristol,Birmingham,Manchester y Gales) es ruidiso y sucio pero moderno [f-blue]e[\/f-blue] importante [f-blue]para la vida de la gente.[\/f-blue](throughout peoples lifes)."],["Mexico, esta cerca de [f-red]las[\/f-red] islas de[f-red]l[\/f-red] [f-red]Caribe y del[\/f-red] América del Norte y de Sudamérica."],["Mexico es[f-blue] famoso por su tranquilidad, playas doradas,[\/f-blue] en el sol y en el futuro quisiera [f-blue]visitar diferentes[\/f-blue] [sline]la [\/sline]playas y comer la [f-blue]caliente[\/f-blue] comida!"],["En mi opin