REIです。
私はアメリカン人。
私はアニメをみまして。
と私は漫画をよみまして。
Now Back to my native tongue.
English
-----------------------------
November 4, 2008 Hello everyone.
I am Rei.
I am American.
I watch anime.
I also read manga.
-----------------------------
I can feel a lot of mistakes in my little paragraph :(
Aside from this little journal I wanted to ask a question.
How exactly do you tell time?
I looked it up on the internet and the sites said different things.
I'm sure a native speaker could point me to the right direction instead of a website.
ありがとうございます
