"Un telefono cellular
SPANISH
---
Hay una telefono cellular que queria tener mucho.
Se llaman el Lollipop LG.
Es el primer que he querido.
Mis padres cada tienen un telefono cellular pero nunca he tenido uno.
El Lollipop LG me parece muy mono y elegante.
No me gusta la generacion segunda, eso es bastante mucho, pero el original es taan luciente, literalmente.
Mirelo: http:\/\/www.mobiletor.com\/images\/lg-lollipop-phone.jpg. e__e
Tiene unos LEDs en el superficie vivo que forman unas imagenitas monas.
En el interior todo es mono tambien.
Sola cosa es que es un telefono cellular que es vendido en Korea..
no pienso que voy a conseguirlo alguno tiempo pronto.
u_u
ENGLISH
---
There is a cell phone that I want a lot.
They call it the Lollipop LG.
It's the first phone that I have wanted.
My parents both have a cell phone but I've never had one.
I feel the Lollipop LG is so cute and classy.
I don't like the second generation, that's rather much, but the original is soo shiny, literally.
Look at it: http:\/\/www.mobiletor.com\/images\/lg-lollipop-phone.jpg. e__e
It has some LEDs on the bright cover that forms some little cute shapes.
Inside everything is cute too.
The only thing is that it's a phone that's sold in Korea..
I don't think I'll get it anytime soon.
