"The First Spanish Letter
A friend of mine will go to Mexico on business for several years.
She can understand Spanish, but I can't.
But I want to send a message to her in Spanish, so I tried to write a Spanish message.
I had to learn from the very beginning.
Using only dictionary, I spent a hour just on writing such short sentences.
Of course, it can't be correct.
I learned Spanish only for 1 hour !
So, please correct.
If you have other suitable expressions, don't hesitate to destroy my original sentences.
You can compose from the beginning.
Her name is \"Idy\"
A message is as follows, please.
Adios, Idy
(Dear Idy)
Soy Takuya.
(I'm Takuya)
Estudie espanol para te escribir in espanol.
(I learned Spanish to write you in Spanish)
Es la primera que estudie espanol.
(This is my first time to study Spanish)
Dificil.
(It's very difficult)
Despues tu iras a Mexico, no me y Comun Beat olvides.
(After you go to Mexico, don't forget me and Common Beat.)
(\"Common Beat\" is the name of our club.)
Nos veremos de nuevo dentro de cinco anos.
(See you again in 5 years)
Estonces me ensenas espanol y baile y aislamiento de cuello de nuevo.
(Then, please tell me Spanish, dance, and isolation of the neck.)
(\"Isolation of the neck\" is the one of the dance technics.)
Adios y que siga usted bien.
(See you, and take care.)
