"Please tell me what this means.
Hola compi de Steven,
Ayer Steven habló con mi padre e incluso con Theresa, que por cierto no sé si desvarió mucho, comentale que en estos momento no es conveniente que vega puesto que en la habitación sólo se pueden entrar dos personas y a unas horas muy determinadas.
Ella está mejorando poco a poco, su estado físico es bastante bueno, la lesión de la espalda que se hizo en la nieve ya está recuperada.
Ahora falta que el hematoma cerebral se reabsorva bien y estaria al 90 %.
Por tu manera de redactar deduzco que dominas el Español, pues si os parece nos podemos comentar los cambios por aqui.
Un abrazo
Helen "],[[],["Hola [sline]compi[f-blue][\/f-blue][\/sline] [f-blue]amigo [\/f-blue]de Steven,"],["Yesterday Steven talked with my father and even with Theresa,I don't know if she raved much at that time. Tell him that at this moment is not a good time for him to come because they only allow 2 people in the room and at certain visiting hours."],["She is improving little by little, her physical state is rather good, the wound on her back ,that she made on the snow, its almost healed. "],["Now we need that the cerebral haematoma be reabsorbed and she would be on her 90%."],["By your way of writting I assume that you dominated the Spanish, so if you like we could exchange any further change in this way."],["A hug"],[]
