se fuerza la máquina
2.
me llaman calle, calle baldosa, la revoltosa, bala perdida
3.
no me rebajo ni por la vida"],[[],[],[],[],[],["se fuerza la máquina [f-blue](\"forzar la máquina\" means, literally, to put a machine to his maximum power, and, figuratively, to struggle, to put all your effort in something till you are exhausted)[\/f-blue]"],[],["me llaman calle, calle baldosa, la revoltosa, bala perdida [f-blue](\"they call me street, floor tile street, the unruly one, stray bullet\", \"bala perdida\" (stray bullet) is an idiom meaning something like \"crackpot\", a person who always does things without thinking in the consequences.)[\/f-blue]"],[],["no me rebajo ni por la vida [f-blue](\"I don't lower myself even if my life is at risk\")[\/f-blue]"]
