"me ayuda. help me by revising my review for a spanish movie.
I watched the movie volver and i was wondering if anyone could look it over and revise.
Me gusta la película \"Volver\" y recomiendo que tu lo veas si no visto.
La película \"Volver\" es muy interesante y muchas cosas occure.
Hay un asesinato y unos secretos.
Raimunda tiene una mala relación con su madre que ella piensa que está muerto.
El hija de Raimunda, Paula, es casi violada por su borracho padrasto, sino que lo mata en defensa propia.
Luego el secreto de Raimunda es revelado.
Cuando era adolescente fue violada por su padre y quedó embarazada con su hijo.
Lo que significa que Paula es en realidad la hija de Raimunda y su hermana."],[[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[]
"Verbs
Hello, 
I have issue remembering my verbs when it comes to working with spanish.
I can write out a sentence in a few different tenses but only with three or four verbs I can recall off the top of my head.
And to make matters worse I freeze up when it comes to calculating and solving the simple sentences that the teacher puts up on the board.
I've had a semester of 101 at my college and on monday I attended the 102 and I saw how far I have to go.
It was humbling to say the least, and would love to hear some stories of other mental obstacles others over came with their new language.
Thanks in advance!
Johnny
P.
S.
Here is a bonus question, do you ever dream in your non native language?"],[[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[]
"HELLO,MR.HAAPY!
