"Say Hi to everyone!
Hello, everyone,
This is my first time posting diary here.
I live in Hong Kong and i am still studying my Policy studies degree in the university.
I am a final year student.
It's kind of busy these weeks.
I have two examinations next week.
I just finished my spanish and mandarin exams last week.
I am so tired.
I am kind of lazy these few days...
Just don't want to do anything...
I want a break....
Maybe i will try to use spanish and french to write my diary next time.
Still, it's good that i can practice my english here.( My english isn't good  *o*)
Cindy Yuen : )"],[[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[]
"Hi you all!
Ok, before I start writing diaries let me introduce myself..
My name is Ayumi.
I am 22 years old.
Currently I'm working for an American company on the US Naval base in mytown Yokosuka, Japan to save some money to go to school in the US hopefully next year.
As you know if you have red my profile, I love to dance.
There's nothing more excting and attractive things to do other then dancing in my life.
So needless to say but just in case you don't see and wanted to ask what I want to study in school, I'd like to study dance.
Maybe in California or possibly NYC..
haven't decided yet though.
And I have lived in Canada Vancouver for about a year and half for dance school.
I do all sorts of dance but the best is JAZZ to the next, CONTEMPORARY.
When I dance, it feels just awsome.
Can't get any feeling like that from anything else.
So I think I will be dancing till the day I die.
lol 
Anyways, I always end up with talking about dance.
Sorry guys but this is really me so be patient plz hahahah
Well, I guess it's time to go now.
I hope to talk to you soon.
Ayumi"],[[],["Ok, before I start writing diaries, let me introduce myself..
