"daily routine
hi everyone, how's going??
i'm little bit tired today.
i had work and dance practice after.
my dance studio is having a dance recital in december.
i am so excited for it but at the same time, am so narvous and feeling like i'm under too much pressure to finish up my solo dance piece by the second week of next month.
im still half way done...
and unfortunately, awsome ideas for the dance aren't coming out from my mind miracly.
i wish i was better at choreographing than i actually am.
anyways, the song i am using for it is \"Far Far\" by Yael Naim.
have any of you heard this song before?
i actually danced wiith this song at the class before and the choreography was so great and well matched.
i decided to use this song for my solo just because i thought it was a beautiful song.
well, there were many songs that i concerned to use for my dance.
but i think it has a beat, kinda melw and has a beautiful lyrics.
but since ive listening this song all the time when i practice by myself.
its kinda getting making me sick and giving me stresses.
so when i feel like that i just watch some old dance videos, dvds and sometimes, i look for some ideas of choreographing on the internet.
these helps me and gives me some influence on it.
well, i still have about 2 weeks until ill show it to my teacher.
i don't know if it's still or ONLY.
i guess i should just do what i am supposed to do and do the best work that i can  do for it.
well, i ended up talking about dance again, as usual.
i'll try not to write about dancing and talk about different things next time.
see ya later!"],[[],[],[],[],[],["i am so excited for it but at the same time, [f-red]I [\/f-red]am so n[f-red]e[\/f-red]rvous and feeling like i'm under too much pressure to finish up my solo dance piece by the second week of next month."],[],[],[],[],[],["i actually danced [f-red]with[\/f-red] this song at the class before and the choreography was so great and well matched."],[],[],["but i think it has a beat, kinda mel[f-red]o[\/f-red]w and has [sline]a[\/sline] beautiful lyrics."],["but since i[f-red]'[\/f-red]ve listening this song all the time when i practice by myself."],[],[],["these help[sline]s[\/sline] me and give[sline]s[\/sline] me some influence on it."],["well, i still have about 2 weeks until i[f-red]'[\/f-red]ll show it to my teacher."],[],[],[],[],[]
"why am i japanese
after work, i met a old friend with 2 of her friends.
they are both here in japan working on the navy base as sailors.
one was korean american and the other one was half japanese and half american.
while we were making our way to a restaurant, this half japanese guy J (i call him J in this dialy )  was telling me how much he loves japan.
he was raised in japan until he moved to america when he was 9 years old.
where he moved in, west virginia was a terrible place to him to live in.
he said he got bullied just because he looked asian and he was descriminated cause he wasn't born in the US and was an immigrant.
i do not understand people that descriminate against others just because of their skins, hair, languages, and caltures etc...
i mean it's just stereotype and descriminating is really stupid thing to do in the whole world.
it shouldn't be even happening in our lives.
but misarably homosapiens fates, it happens and some people are killing themselves unable to contain their pains.
but meanwhile the ones who bullied those are living with no pain or even filled with happiness.
so pathetic.
i mean i would never ever do such things to others.
well, i guess i got off the subject a little bit...
let's get back!
lol.
so he was asking me those how i loved living in the US and i hated living in japan...
cause everything that he talked about japan were possitive things.
maybe im too disliking japan.
i don't i guess it doesn't look attractive to me anymore and since i've had experience that living out of japan and had a few different things that i never could do in japan.
and maybe most of those who has only lived in japan doesn't onderstand what i feel.
he asked me if i didn't have a pride, i said 'no' i mean i didn't choose japan to be born in and it doesn't mean that if i was born in japan so i perfectly fit in the enviroment.
ya know?
i always longed for american culture and living in different contries and my mom has lived in California for school then she used to tell me the stories that she had in the states and she had many friends that were from all over the world so i think it kinda led me the way i am now and my actual experience.
i don't know if there's someone who could understand my feeling but this is what i think.
i mean living in japan isn't too bad but i think there are more that i want and like...
yahh.
so when i told him about it he looked kinda disappointed and said he never met a japanese like me yeahh i guess not.
maybe i'm exceptional =)"],[[],["after work, i met [f-red]an[\/f-red] old friend with 2 of her friends."],[],["one was korean[f-blue]-[\/f-blue]american and the other one was half japanese and half american."],["while we were making our way to a restaurant, this half japanese guy J ([f-red]i'll[\/f-red] call him J in this [f-red]diary[\/f-red] )  was telling me how much he loves japan."],["he was raised in [f-red]J[\/f-red]apan until he moved to [f-red]America[\/f-red] when he was 9 years old."],["where he moved in, west virginia was a terrible place [f-red]for[\/f-red] him to live in."],[],[],[],[],["but [f-red]miserably[\/f-red] [f-blue]is[\/f-blue] homosapien[f-red]'s[\/f-red] fate[sline]s[\/sline], it happens and some people are killing themselves unable to contain their pains. [f-blue](not sure if I changed your main idea, but I think it sounds better this way)[\/f-blue]"],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],["maybe i[f-red]'[\/f-red]m [sline]too[\/sline] disliking japan."],[],[],["he asked me if i didn't have a pride, i said 'no' i mean i didn't choose japan to be born in and it doesn't mean that if i was born in japan [sline]so[\/sline] [f-red]i'll[\/f-red] perfectly fit in the enviroment."],[],["i always longed for american culture and living in different [f-red]countries[\/f-red] and my mom has lived in California for school then she used to tell me the stories that she had in the states and [f-blue]that[\/f-blue] she had many friends that were from all over the world so i think [f-red]its[\/f-red] kinda [f-red]letting[\/f-red] me the way i am now and my actual experience."],[],[],[],[],[]
