"¡Por Favor! Beg\/Int English Learner needed
(En español abajo)
NEEDED: Beg\/Int English Learner, HISPANOHABLANTE NATIVO
When needed: Tuesday October 27th, Between the hours of 2-5 (14:00-17:00) PST (Other times possible, just message me!)
Hello lang-8 friends!
I need a native Spanish speaker who is learning English to help me with a university project.
You must be beginner or intermediate level.
For the project we would chat through an instant messenger (Live MSN, Skype o AIM) in English for 20-30 minutes about your experience with the English language, your hobbies, and your travels through the English speaking world.
During the interview, please don’t use a dictionary, but try to rely on your own English knowledge.
I will use our conversation to analyze your difficulties with English and how your native Spanish language influences your errors\/mistakes.
If you would like to read my final project or see the corrections for our conversation, I can send them to you when I finish it on the 2nd of December.
Also, if you would like we could chat in English or Spanish in the future!
If you are interested and can chat sometime in the hours listed above, please message me along with your Live MSN, AIM, or Skype id and tell me what time works best for you.
If you are interested but cannot chat during the hours above, let me know when you are available according to PST.
Thank you very much!
--Marisa
