Day 1: Qoute of the day
How do you know when the passionate burning love you had for a person is put out?
The energy you had trying to be with this person is all tired out from the argueing?
Well you don't but you do know when its time to give up when you are done waiting for the relationship to get better.
My advice is to stick it threw if you truely loved this person you wont have no problems with their flaws you would except them but, for those of you who don't except your partners flaws should know that there is no such thing as being a perfectionist because everyone has a flaw.
