"New Car! Carro Nuevo!
Hooray!
I got a new car today!
The wait was long and I was starving the whole day but it was worth it!
It runs smoothly and it's really fast!
I'm so happy!
My old car was old and didn't run as well so anything would be an improvement!
It also has a cd player!
It's really exciting!
Well that was my whole day basically..
Until next time.
Good bye!
Hooray!
Yo compré un carro nuevo hoy!
La espera fue largo y yo fue hambre mucho pero merece la pena!
Es muy rapido!
Estoy muy contenta!
Mi carro viejo era viejo!
Mi carro tiene un reproductor de cds tambien!
Es emocionante!
Básicamente, eso era mi dia.
Hasta luego!
I really tried my best with that translation!
I used a dictionary with the words I didn't know so hopefully it doesn't sound to formal or awkward.
Well thank you for reading this!
