"Aves
My neighbor is going away.
Mi vecino se va.
I'm going to take care of his birds for him.
Voy a cuidar por sus aves por él.
There're two big birds and three small birds.
Hay dos aves grandes y tres aves pequeños
They talk very well.
Ellos hablan muy bien.
One of them say to me, \"Hi!\"
