"Una día muy mala. 
070711
Today I woke up at 8:30.
I had an interview at Forever 21.
My boyfriend Taylor was going to drive me, but his mom took the car to work.
I asked my other friend to take me to the mall, but he said no.
I missed the interview and later my laptop broke.
Today was a very bad day for me!
Hoy me levantá a 8:30.
Tuve una entrevista por Forever 21.
Mi novio Taylor estaba me manejar, pero su madre llevó el carro por trabajo.
Preguntá mi otro amigo me manejar al centro comercial, pero le dice no.
Perdí la entrevista y posterior mi computadora rota.
