"Do you have a experience of spam mail?
I recieved a friend request mail.
But I have seen like it before in another SMS web.
It goes like;
\"single never married, tall slim,and fair.....\"
I thought suspicious a little.
There is no need to write it to learn a language.
First time I accepted it and after all I got so many spam mail.
And now this is the 4th.
Everybody, please do not be attracted by nice looking and sweet words!!
Read the message well.
There will be so many virus among the spam mail!!"],[["Do you have any experience with spam mail?"],["I received a friend request in my mail."],["But I have seen [f-blue]the same thing[\/f-blue] before in another SMS web [f-blue]before[\/f-blue]."],["It goes like this:"],[],["I thought it was a little suspicious. "],[],["The first time, I accepted it and after that I got so much spam mail."],["And now this is the 4th one\/time."],[],[],[]
