"spanish practice 5?
Yo quiero ser la astronomo.
El quiere ser al pianista y el musico.
La escritor amore su riqueza.
(The writer loves his wealth.)
La plioto quiere su esposa.
La musico amore su cachorro\/perro que es blance y en su casa.
(the musician loves his puppy that is blanco and is raised in his house)
Nosotros quermos viages london!
(We want to go on a trip to london)
¿Vosotros quereis magia?
(do you want to do magic?
 )
¿Porque quereis magia?
(why do you want to do magic?)
Porque amos eso.
(because we love it)
¿ámores mi?
(Do you love me?)
si, amoro.
(yes, i do.)"],[[],["Yo quiero ser [f-blue][sline]la[\/sline][\/f-blue] astrónom[f-red]a[\/f-red]."],["El quiere ser [sline][f-blue]al [\/f-blue][\/sline]pianista y [f-blue][sline]el[\/sline][\/f-blue] musico."],["La escritor[f-red]a[\/f-red] [f-red]ama[\/f-red] su riqueza."],[],["La piloto [f-red]ama[\/f-red] su esposa. (In Spanish we have two kind of love, the deeply one (Family, husband, girlfriend, a very good and close friends) and the other when you appreciate someone. The first one we called amo and the second one its quiero)<o:p><\/o:p>"],["El músico [f-red]ama[\/f-red] su cachorro [f-red]([\/f-red]or[f-red] perrito)[\/f-red] [f-blue][sline]\/perro[\/sline][\/f-blue] que es [f-red]blanco[\/f-red] y [f-red]creció[\/f-red] en su casa."],[],["[f-red]¡[\/f-red]Nosotros quer[f-red]e[\/f-red]mos [f-red]viajar[\/f-red] a[f-red] Londres![\/f-red]"],[],["¿Vosotros quereis magia? (Thats correct under Spain and South America form. Countries like Panama, Venezuela, Puerto Rico, Mexico do not use the form vosotros. We are using the form usted or tu.)"],[],[],[],[],["Porque [f-red]lo amamos[\/f-red]"],[],["¿[f-red]me amas[\/f-red]?"],[],["si, [f-red]te amo[\/f-red]."],[]
