"can anybody hear me?
Satturday
9:31 p.m.
Heeey!
One month left, right...
But I'm not so upset acutally :D To tell the truth I want to go to school...
a bit...
 )) Since this month I've got increased internet speed!!!
Four times as high as before!!!!
1 mbit\/s, wow...
I'm very glad, really ))) Now I can watch any videos in the internet not waiting till it's loading!
It's awful ^^ Oh, I should prepare myself for school, to buy books, ex.
books, pens, pencils, and other stuff.
I miss school, ahhaha LOL In a week of studying I'm gonna say, \"Shit, I hate this school, when will the summer come??!!!\", nearly sure ))))) OKay, what else.
A week or two ago I met a guy in vkontakte.
ru.
Then I added him in skype, so, he's learning Japanese, has just begun learning unlike me, because I began learning it more than a year ago.
And sometimes I help him with learning, he's a nice guy, his name is Yelisey, 15 years old like me, he's blond like me, loves Japan and dreams of going and staying there forever like me...
xDD When I first heard his voice, I thought he was about 19!
Really, his voice is pretty rough, I wanna have such voice too ^^ So, I let him meet Matsudaira-san (that good funny Japanese guy with who I talk in skype sometimes), and the became a friend of his like me, too :D But what's the best...
He's inviting us to visit Japan!!!
He said that if we went to Japan to Kobe (the city he lives in) we could stay at him!
Sugoi!!!
He earns $3000 every day...
YES, EVERY DAY!!!
O_O I got fucking amazed on knowing that!!!
And he can pay for our trip (mine and Yelisey's) on working just a day!!!
Isn't that amazing??
He's such a person who I can trust, he's really good, he laughs a lot, his voice is good, he has a family, a wife and a 13-years-old daughter.
So, I've got no reason not to trust him, and if he could pay for our trip I would be the most greatful boy in the world!!!
Yelisey would, too.
We didn't talk about that he could pay for our trip, but I hope we will ^^ And if we don't, I will have to save money to next summer (we're going to go to Japan next summer, for the whole summer!!!), we are going to meet in Moscow (I and Yelisey), and then go to airport, and...
to JAPAN *__* WOW!!
 )))) We were talking about what we could do there for hours last night...
So, I hope our dream is going to COME TRUE ))))) I'm smiling ))))) Because I feel so happy!!!
Of course anyway I will have got to wait for all next studying year, but...
I'll cope with it!
:D Japan...
the country of my dream...
Also I've another friend of Japan in my skype list.
His nickname is Shiitan.
He doesn't want to call me his real name.
So, today morning I guess I was talking to him for 3 hours!
(Writing, not speaking), it was very difficult for me to understand him, but I could.
Then we began talking abou ero )) Like almost every Japanese boy, he is a little pervert...
