"Segundos Ejercicios
Hay cualquier cosas bajo la mesa.
Quiero conseguir muchos libros de historia.
Estoy caminando por la parque bonita.
Los perros comen nuestra lechon.
¿Porqué me abandonas mi amor?
Escribo un correo por el alcalde.
Esa ayuntamiento estás dos cientos años.
Nuestra iglesia está anciano.
Vosotros estáis mi amigo bueno.
Dormo tarde de noche.
Empeso una ventura nueva.
Voy a tienda de ropa.
No cerro las ventanas."],[[],[],[],["Estoy caminando por el bonito parque"],[],[],["Escribo un correo para el alcalde."],["Ese ayuntamiento tiene dos cientos años."],["Nuestra iglesia es antigua"],[],["Duermo tarde en la noche"],["Empiezo una nueva aventura"],["Voy a la tienda de ropa."],["No cierro las ventanas."]
"My first diary
Hi everyone who might read my diary.
I'm little glad to find this website.
I'm so eager to learn english just like other Asian.
I'm writing this in midnight since I was so bored.
I have to go to work which I don't like to do.
I thought I could be a teacher or someone similiar after passing TOFEL for being exchange student.
However, it turned out that I'm not enough to be a english teacher for official english intutition.
Anyways...
for earning some money, I'm working in english institution as book editor.
I will study in USA next year as a exchange student just for one year.
Then maybe I could attempt again to teach someone.
I don't know what kinds of things I would like to write since I'm not used to make my own diary.
I think as I overview what I wrote from now, it became sort of self-introduction.
I'm going to write my dairy life on this website even though I do not this in my mother tongue Korean.
I wish that I will be able to find something meaningful through this diary writing.
Maybe I could find myself who will be struggling on things which actually easy to get over but considering as hard to solve."],[[],[],[],["I'm so eager to learn english just like other Asians\/Asian people."],["I'm writing this at midnight since I was so bored."],["I have to go to work which I don't like."],["I thought I could be a teacher or someone similiar after passing the TOFEL exam for being an exchange student."],["However, it turned out that I'm not good enough to be an english teacher for an official English intutition."],[],["To earn some money, I'm working in an English institution as book editor."],["I will study in USA next year as a exchange student for one year."],["Then maybe I could try to teach again."],["I don't know what kind of things I would like to write about since I'm not used to writing a diary."],["I think as I overview what I wrote just now, it became a sort of self-introduction."],["I'm going to write my daily life on this website even though I do not do this in my mother tongue, Korean."],["I wish I can find something meaningful through this diary writing."],["Maybe I could find myself who will be struggling on things which actually easy to get over but considering as hard to solve. (this is difficult to understand)"]
