"Civil case
Copyright
Civil action of  the close corporation “Commersant” against LLC “Agency FLB”
\tOn the 29 of July in 2002 in the newspaper “Commersant” was published an article about the crash of the most secure airplane.
The author of this article was  the staff man of that very newspaper.
Besides, there was a prohibition of publishing these materials in other resources of information.
\tNot long after, defendant published the same article on the web-site.
As we know, the administrative takes all responsibilities for all actions.
So the “Kommersant” sued LLC “agency FLB”  for infringing act.
\tAccording to case materials the web-site of the defendant is highly visited.
Plaintiff has also its web-site with paid materials for its users.
So this kind of services is the way of doing its business.
That is why when users can find the same information in the other resource, they surely will not pay for it on the plaintiff’s web-site.
\tThe court resolved to recover damages to the amount of 50000 rub."],[[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[]
