"so much for the 2008!
Finally, it has come to the end of the year which means i can go home very soon.14 days later i will be home agian.
I do miss my dearest dad and sweatest mum.
Can't believe my first term in uni is almost finished.
For 4 months, i live in shanghai all by myself.
I become somehow more independent and stronger.
Before that i am just a teenage girl under the 100% protection of parents.
But now i can do lots of things of myself.
looking back at the 2008, i just have to say it's sucks.
i am almost fail in everything.
In the most important year of mine, i fail in the entrance exams of university and what's more, i broke up with my boyfriend!
what could i say?
i used to think i can enter one of the best unis,but i ruined it all by myself cause i fell in love with a boy.
thank god,i finally luckly enough to go to the place i want to be and achieved my dream of learning to be a reporter.
and for the boy,yes,he completely broke my heart.
so much coincidences made us together.
he used to be so gentle and sweat.
and then suddenly one day as the script we wrote\" everything changed\",he broke up with me in the most cruletest way by not saying \"break up\" but did the \"break up\" things.
he just disappears.
never called me or answered the phones.
can't believe the song which links us together become my story.\" i stay in love\" maybe a hip-hop boy and a punk girl could never be together.
\"i can't even know what to say.
i;ve been hurt i've been played and i'm so ashamed.
i can't evencry.
it's that deep.
you just lie and you just cheat.
like it's nothing.
see yousaid you loved me too and so i trust you but i guess that subconsciously knew .
but i never met a boy so true.
neverthought of me and you.
but you just fronting.
aye boy thanks for nothing.
i never knew enough about you babe.
i guess i only have myself to blame.
now i'm broken hearted and shatttering.
you were just play a game...
i don't know how to face him 14 days later.
god bless me.
i want to hate him but i can't.
it's suffering to pretend we are strangers.
my 100% right's six sence tells me that i will meet him with his new girlfriend on the street.
should i smile and say hello or just walk away?
anyway in 2008 i got to know the most important thing in the word is the love from your family and the love of your friends.
they do help me a lot in the harest time of mine.
thanks to them, my sucks 2008 doesn't fail to death.
i still be happy,looking forward a brand new day,looking forward to come home soon to meet everybody.
even him.
watch out, i do want to kick your ass.(LOL) so, so what!
so much for my happy ending..."],[[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[]
