"Two Questions
Hi everybody,
how is everything going??
I hope you are all pretty well
I have two questions:
1) What is the meaning of the word 'fulano'??
And when I can use it?
I really shocked when I saw it.
My face was like this O.
O
We have the same word in Arabic, but without the O in the end: 'fulan فلان' for males and 'fulana فلانه' for females.
2)What people say when they answer the phone??
And is it different from Spain to Latin America to the States??
Thanks,
^^"],[[],[],[],[],[],["1) What is the meaning of the word 'fulano'?? [f-bold][f-blue]Fulano is a prostitute, we use this word when don't you know the name of te person, for example \"¿Si fulano va al cine, tu también vas?\". refiriéndose a alguien indeterminado[\/f-blue][\/f-bold]"],[],[],[],[],[],["2)What people say when they answer the phone?? [f-bold][f-blue]For answer the phone we say \"si?\" or \"diga?\"[\/f-blue][\/f-bold]"],[],[],[]
"Una cabaña cerca del mar  1 
Esta cabaña hermosa tiene 500 años.
Está en el campo cerca del pueblo de Ringmore,donde hay una oficina de correos y una tienda pequeña.
La cabaña tiene dos dormitorios doble , un baño grande, y un inodoro.
La sala tiene unos muebles simpáticos y antiguos, y un (open fire??).
Hay un jardín grande con flores y árboles.
Hay algunas restaurantes muy buenos cercanos.
Hay un televisión de colores, un garaje y un horno eléctrico.
El mar está tres millas lejos.
This beautiful cottage is 500 years old.
It's in the countryside near the village of Ringmore, where there is a post office and a small shop.
The cottage has double bedrooms, a big bathroom, and a toilet.
The living room has lovely antique furniture and an open fire.
There is a big garden with flowers and trees.
There are some very good restaurants nearby.
There's  color TV, garage and electric cooker.
The sea is three miles away."],[[],[],[],["La cabaña tiene dos dormitorios doble[f-blue][f-bold]s[\/f-bold][\/f-blue], un baño grande, y un inodoro."],["La sala tiene unos muebles [sline]simpáticos[\/sline] [f-blue][f-bold]bonitos [\/f-bold][\/f-blue]y antiguos, y un [sline](open fire??).[\/sline] [f-blue][f-bold]hogar.[\/f-bold][\/f-blue]"],[],["Hay algun[f-bold][f-blue]o[\/f-blue][\/f-bold]s restaurantes muy buenos [sline]cercanos.[\/sline] [f-blue][f-bold]cerca de allí.[\/f-bold][\/f-blue]"],["Hay un [sline]televisión de colores[\/sline] [f-blue][f-bold]televisor a color[\/f-bold][\/f-blue], un garaje y un horno eléctrico."],["El mar está [f-blue][f-bold]a [\/f-bold][\/f-blue]tres millas [sline]lejos[\/sline].
