2- Pierre is a French name.
Pierre es un nombre Francés.
3- Oxford is an English university.
Oxford es una universidad Inglesa.
4- Milan is an Italian city.
Milán es una ciudad Italiana.
5- English is an international language.
El inglés es un idioma internacional.
6- Mercedes is a German Car.
Mercedes es un carro Alemán.
7- Pentax is a Japanese camera.
Pentax es una cámara Japonesa.
===
How can I describe something with more than one adjective?
For example how can I translate these sentences into Spanish?
* Milan is a beautiful Italian city.
* Mohammad is a common Arabic name.
* This lady has attractive blue eyes.
===
