"Preterite\/Imperfect 
If my professor were to ask, \"when did you start doing the dishes at your house?\"
and \"when was the last time you set the table?\" what would they be in spanish?
Also how would I respond in Spanish using the preterite or imperfect?
when did you start doing the dishes at your house?
Would the answer be: Cuanda teniá dice años.
When I was 10.
when was the last time you set the table?
Navidad pasado.
