"Mi plan para este verano
Ahora estoy estudiando en la universidad, pero las vacaciones de verano va a comenzar en el mes siguiente.
Entonces, voy a trabajar de nuevo en la escuela para las estudiantes internacional.
En este escuela, hay estudiantes que vienen de las países muy diversido.
Por esta razón, conozco muchas personas de las diferente países, y 
posiblemente es por qué he empezado a tener más interés en otras culturas.
Trabajaré por un par de mes, hasta que me voy para un vacacion en agosto ;)"],[[],["Ahora estoy estudiando en la universidad, pero las vacaciones de verano va[f-blue]n[\/f-blue] a comenzar [sline]en[\/sline] el [f-blue]próximo[\/f-blue] mes [sline]siguiente[\/sline]."],["Entonces, voy a trabajar de nuevo en la escuela para l[f-blue]o[\/f-blue]s estudiantes internacional[f-blue]es[\/f-blue]. (yo pondría \"...trabajar de nuevo en la escuela enseñando a estudiantes internacionales\", pues no se trabaja \"para\" los alumnos, se les enseña)"],["En est[f-blue]a[\/f-blue] escuela, hay estudiantes que vienen de [sline]las[\/sline] países muy [sline]diversido[\/sline] [f-blue]diversos[\/f-blue]."],["Por esta razón, conozco muchas personas de [sline]las[\/sline] diferente[f-blue]s[\/f-blue] países, y "],["posiblemente [sline]es por qué[\/sline] [f-blue]es por esto[\/f-blue] que he empezado a tener más interés en otras culturas."],["Trabajaré por un par de mes[f-blue]es[\/f-blue], hasta que me v[f-blue]aya[\/f-blue] [sline]para un vacacion[\/sline] [f-blue]de vacaciones [\/f-blue]en agosto ;)"]
"Una carta a mi amiga en España
Despues abril (cuandó las vacaciones de verano he comenzado por los estudiantes universitarios) yo fue muy ocupado con dos trabajos.
Un trabajo a tiempo completo en una escuela de inglés internacional que he trabajado para quinta veranos, y así la tutoría.
En agosto, fui a japón con mis amigas rusa-coreanos!
Ellas fueron estudiantes en la escuela dondé yo trabajaba.
Japón era tan caliente como cuando estuvimos allí hace dos años.
Sentí que se estaba derritiendo..
Fuiste a algún lugar durante sus vacaciones de verano?
Ahora hace un mes que la universidad se comience de nuevo.
Este año, me cambié mi especializacion del Estudios Internacionales a la Sociología.
El curso fue demasiado acerca de la política que yo no entiendo mucho..
Estaba interesado en \"la sociología, la psicología y la antropología\" (los tres en un curso) desde la escuela secundaria, así que estoy contento con la nueva especializacion.
Estoy tomando el siguiente nivel de español tambien.
No quiero olvidar este hermosa idioma así que tengo que practicar más!!
En el libro de curso, se presentó información sobre la España y estaba pensando de usted.
Realmente espero ir algún día.
Espero que la vida le trata bien!
Cuídale mucho!
[**Mi amiga es un adulto, así que utiliza el formulario de tercera persona del singular]"],[[],["Después abril (cuando las vacaciones para los estudiantes universitarios comienzan) yo estuve muy ocupado con dos trabajos."],["Un trabajo a tiempo completo en una escuela de inglés internacional en la que he trabajado por cinco veranos, y la tutoría."],["En agosto, fui a japón con mis amigas ruso-coreanas!"],[],["Japón era tan cálido como cuando estuvimos allí dos años atrás."],["Sentí que me estaba derritiendo..."],["¿Fué a algún lugar durante sus vacaciones de verano?"],["Ahora hace un mes que la universidad comenzó de nuevo."],["Este año, cambié mi especialidad de Estudios Internacionales a Sociología."],["El curso era demasiado acerca de política y no entendí mucho..."],["Estaba interesado en \"sociología, psicología y antropología\" (los tres en el mismo curso) desde la escuela secundaria, así que estoy contento con mi nueva especialidad."],[],["No quiero olvidar este hermoso idioma, así que tengo que practicar más!!"],["En el libro de curso viene información sobre España y pensé en usted."],[],["Espero que la vida le trate bien!"],["Cuídese mucho!"],[]
"Buen Sabado
Hola, mis amigos,
Hoy fué un día normal por mi, con un excepción:  Yo visito con miembros de mi familia.
Yo visitado con mi madre y mis dos hermanas.
Teníamos un buen vez.
Yo tocado la guitara y cantado y todos se gustan.
Por los menos, ellos lo dijo.
Usualmente, no veo nadie durante el día.
Tengo problemas mental:  depresión, ansiedad, y no me gusta contactar nadie.
Me gusta permanecer en la cama o jugar en la computador."],[[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[]
"journal entry  #4 : school cultures
To me i really don't know which is the best between spanish country school and united states school.
some advantages are that we have shorter schools days and a longer summer vacation.
We also can ask the teacher a question if we do not understand anything that the teacher explained in the lesson.
We also are called by our first name instead  of our last name and we call our teacher's by their last names(Mr.
Davis).
Some disadvantanges are that we learn leaser things then the spanish school and we don't leave school early like them either."],[[],[],[],[],[],[],[]
"Story about love.
Some days ago i read a essay about love.
It was  a story about a girl who was a senior high school student called Jane felt in love with a boy, called Kan.
Kan invited Jane to go out with him, they laughed and they kissed, but the boy never said he loved Jane.
Each time they kissed, Jane felt happy.
Kan always said, if you felt happy, that's enough.
Jane never asked Kan whether he loved her or not, for she thought that she was too ugly to match Kan,
They were facing college entrance exam.
One day Kan asked Jane who she felt that he would love.
\"Lisa\", Jane said immediately.
For Lisa was a pretty girl and everyone in campus said she matched Kan.
Kan nodded, smiled.
Few days later Kan went with Lisa hand in hand.
Jane saw their laghters and hugs.
After finishing college entrance exam, they seperated.
A year's later, when Jane met Lisa by chace in the street, when they talked about Kan, Lisa surprised to tell Jane, \"Don't you know, we weren't together indeed, Kan just pretended loving me in order to make you put your heart in study.
He loves you, not me!\"
Back in home, Jane cried.
In my life, I have a friend, she ever felt in love with a guy, and that guy also loved my friend too.
The odd thing was they never talked!
They communicated though eyes contact!
Of course they never got together and never broke up.
They just met, smiled, loved and missed.
Sometimes we may ask why the people who really love each can't get together.
I can give an exactly answer here, but I would like to say, maybe we were all too yough at that time, we didn't know how to cherish, didn't know what exactly love was, or maybe, youth has no endings."],[[],["Some time ago I read an essay about love."],["It was  a story about a girl named Jane, a senior in high school, who fell in love with a boy called Kan."],["Eventually Kan asked Jane to go out with him. They laughed and they kissed, but the boy never said he loved Jane."],["However, each time they kissed, Jane felt incredibly happy."],["Kan always said, \"If you feel happy, then that's enough for me.\""],["Jane felt she was too ugly for Kan, so she never worked up the courage to ask him whether or not he loved her."],["Soon they faced college entrance exams."],["One day Kan asked Jane who she thought he would be in love with."],[],["For Lisa was a pretty girl and everyone at school said she matched Kan."],["Kan nodded, and smiled."],["A few days later, Kan walked with Lisa, hand in hand."],["Jane saw their laughter and hugs."],["After finishing the college entrance exams, they separated."],["A year later, when Jane met Lisa by chance in the street, they talked about Kan. Jane was shocked to hear Lisa tell her, \"Didn't you know? We weren't together at all, Kan just pretended to love me in order to make you put your heart in study."],[],["Back at home, Jane cried."],["I have a friend in real life, who was in love with a guy. And he loved her back!"],["The odd thing was that they never talked!"],["They said they communicated though eye contact!"],["Of course, they never got together and thus never broke up"],[],["Sometimes we may ask why the people who really love each other can't get together."],["I can't exactly offer an answer, but I would like to say, maybe we were too young at the time; we didn't know how to cherish, didn't know what exactly love was. But then again, maybe youth has no ending."]
"poem
I missed your childhood, your youth,
The river of life had many occasional turnings,
and went by the wilderness of plain.
Then, I found you.
我错过了你的童年,少年.
生命的河不经意的转弯,
以及流过平原的荒野.
遇见我"],[[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[]
"¡Finalmente, puedo acceso al Internet!
¡Finalmente, puedo acceso al Internet!(Finally, I can access to the internet!)
Debo levantarme en 7 o' registre por la mañana para atender a clases hasta 6 o' registre por la tarde.(I should get up at 7 o'clock in the morning to attend classes till 6 o'clock in the afternoon.)
¡cuál es incluso peor, debo ace la misma mañana de viernes del profesor en general!
(what's even worse, I should face the same teacher on the whole friday morning!!)
Tengo menos tiempo ahora para aprender español.(I have less time to learn spanish now)
¿qué puedo hacer?
(what can i do?)"],[[],["¡Finalmente, [sline]puedo[\/sline][f-blue] tengo[\/f-blue] acceso al Internet!(Finally, I can access to the internet!)"],["Debo levantarme [sline]en 7 o' registre[\/sline] [f-blue]a las 7[\/f-blue] [sline]por[\/sline] [f-blue]de[\/f-blue] la mañana para atender a clases hasta [f-blue]las [\/f-blue]6 [sline]o' registre por[\/sline] [f-blue]de [\/f-blue]la tarde.(I should get up at 7 o'clock in the morning to attend classes till 6 o'clock in the afternoon.)"],["¡[sline]cuál [\/sline][f-blue] lo que es [\/f-blue]es incluso peor, [sline]debo ace la misma mañana de viernes del profesor en general![\/sline] [f-blue]tengo clases con el mismo profesor toda la mañana del viernes.[\/f-blue]"],[],[],[],[]
"Exam
I am going to take an exam recently, so i don't have much time to go to the internet, I'm going to show up again after I finish my exam.
Good luck to me."],[[],[],[]
"new.
well~suddenly i became a newbie here in lang-8~ i don't know what exactly my feeling is~coz i've been registered in so many websites which is for language study~so i can not behave like an excited person or something else.
but there something new to me here is i should introduce myself in this new blog~,it's a little bit strange.
well am i chinese~some people in the internet ask me whether i am a foreigner or not~well ~coz i don't know ur nationality so i can't give you a exact answer~:) if you r not a chinese~to you ~well~am a foreigner~
am a college student and am busy in preparing my finally exams now~i've just finished my japanese exam~it didn't hard for me to finish it~but~it's hard for me to learn my grade.
i hope i can learn japanese as well as my english~probably this is my new year's wish.
i suddenly knew that i haven't made a wish in new year's eve.
actually chinese' new year hasn't come yet~ coz we celebrate a luna new year~.
it's a coincidence that this year's new year time is the same date with valentine's day.
:)
i've had a long time haven't write such a long passage, maybe i'll come here to write my diary, coz none of my friends or classmated know this website.
hope all of you nice."],[[],["Well suddenly I've become a newbie here on Lang-8. I don't know what exactly my feelings are, coz I've been registered in so many websites for language study. I cannot behave as if I were excited or something."],["But as this is all new to me, I should introduce myself in this blog, which I find a bit strange."],["Well I am Chinese. Some people on the internet ask me whether or not I am a foreigner. Well, if I don't know your nationality I can't give you an exact answer :) If you are not Chinese, then to you, well, I am indeed a foreigner!"],["I am a college student and am busy in preparing for my final exams now. I've just finished my Japanese exam; it wasn't hard for me to finish it, but, it's hard for me to discern my grade. [f-blue](Did you mean find out how you scored? Or to guess at how you might have done?)[\/f-blue]"],["I hope I can learn Japanese as well as I know English - this is my wish for the new year."],["I suddenly realized that I haven't made a wish on New Year's eve."],["but actually, Chinese new year hasn't come yet, coz we celebrate a lunar new year."],["It's quite a coincidence that the new year begins on the same day as Valentine's Day, this year."],[],["It's been a while since I've written such a long passage. Perhaps I'll use this site to write my diary, coz none of my friends or classmates know of this website."],["I hope all of you are nice!"]
"The Spirit Festival (Chinese Halloween!)
En el 14 del Julio Calendario lunar chino es el Festival de Fantasma en Chino.( July 14 through Chinese Lunar calender is the Spirit Festival in China.)
Pero, el Festival de fantasma en Chino es diferente de Halloween's Day en países del oeste.
(But the Spirit Festival in China is different from the Halloween's Day in West coutries.)
En el día, Chinos adore a dioses.(In that day, chinese worship the gods.)
El fieles endecha regalos en la fronda de dioses.( the worshippers lay the gifts and the sacrifices in frond of the gods)
El Festival de Fantasma es uno Festival para los muertos ( the Spirit Festival is the Festival for the dead)
Tan muchos chinos no saldrá ni viajará.( so many Chinese will not go out or travel)"],[[],["El 14 [f-blue]de [\/f-blue]Julio [f-blue]en el[\/f-blue] Calendario lunar chino es el[f-blue] \"dia de los muertos\"[\/f-blue] (en Chi[f-blue]na)[\/f-blue]. \/\/\/\/You don't really need to add \"en China\" at the end of the sentence. Also, \"Festival de Fantasma\" could be \"Fiesta de los fantasmas\", but the 'official' name is \"dia de los muertos\". I think it can also be called \"(dia de) todos los santos\" "],["Pero, el dia de los muertos en China es diferente de Halloween's Day en [f-blue]los [\/f-blue]países del oeste."],[],["En [f-blue]ese [\/f-blue]día, [f-blue]los [\/f-blue]Chinos ador[f-blue]an[\/f-blue] a [f-blue]los [\/f-blue]dioses.(In that day, chinese worship the gods.)"],["[f-blue]Los [\/f-blue]fieles [f-blue]ofrecen [\/f-blue]regalos y [f-blue]sacrificios a los [\/f-blue] dioses.( the worshippers lay the gifts and the sacrifices in frond of the gods)"],["El Festival de los Fantasmas es [f-blue]un [\/f-blue]Festival [f-blue]para recordar a[\/f-blue] los muertos ( the Spirit Festival is the Festival for the dead)"],["[sline]Tan [\/sline]Muchos chinos no sal[f-blue]drán(de sus casas?)[\/f-blue] ni viaja[f-blue]rán[\/f-blue].( so many Chinese will not go out or travel)"]
"Happy New Year
Feb.13 is Chinese lunar New Year Eve.
At that night, like all western countries celebrate Christmas Eve, my families and I stayed together to have dinner, In fact, Chinese families ues to to have all big family members to stay together, all family members, let's say, including grandparents,uncles, aunts, sisters, brothers, sometimes cousins.
Since my uncle's family live in Guangzhou city and they didn't comeback home, so we just had my grandma stay with us this year.
As to the food of that evening, we have fish, pork, beef, vegetables, some will have mutton.
We usually prepare a lot of food so that after dinner we can have something left, the phenomenon is called \"年年有余”，which implies we have money left or we can get a good savings in the following year.
In the daytime of the New Year Eve, my brother tore away the old couplets and pasted new couplets in the wall between my house gate.
The couplets were written in some greetings, it is said that the coulpets can bring good luck to the whold families.
After dinner, we usually watch a TV program named Spring Festival Gala Evening, which is made and broadcasted by CCTV, most Chinese people  watch that each year.
But I thought it was just everage this year.
BTW, this programme comes out just one time a year at New Year Eve.
The pic I got is 2009's programme, I couldn't find a 2010 one, sorry.
But the form of the programme is similiar each year, they have the performances of singging and dancing and opusculum, magic show appears in recent years.
When the ring bells at 12 o'clock at night, you can hear the sounds of firecrackers and the fireworks everywhere.
I live in a county, there is no strict rulls about banning setting off firecrackers and fireworks.
So when the New Year came, my pa and my brother and I went downstairs
to the street in front of our house to set off firecrackers and fireworks.
In my hometown, you can see nobody at the moment because what you can see is the smoke the firecrackers and fireworks left.
When you looked at the sky, the fireworks plaied freely and decorated the whole sky with beautiful bright flowers.
Since the New Year came, ma pa and ma ma were the person who my brother and I asked for red envelopes.
Though my brother and I are already college students, but we don't have jobs, so it's still okey to asked aldults for red envelopes.
Some districts in China has another custom, if one never get marry, then he can always ask for red envelopes from the ppeople who already married though the person may younger than him:)
Wish all of you a best new year!"],[[],[],["At that night, like all western countries celebrate Christmas Eve, my families and I stayed together to have dinner. In fact, Chinese families [f-blue]used[\/f-blue] to to have all [sline]big [\/sline][f-blue]extended [\/f-blue]family members to stay together, all family members, let's say, including grandparents,uncles, aunts, sisters, brothers, [f-blue]and [\/f-blue]sometimes cousins."],["Since my uncle's family live[f-blue]s[\/f-blue] in Guangzhou city and they didn't come back home, [sline]so[\/sline] we just had my grandma stay with us this year."],[],[],["In the daytime of the New Year[f-blue]s[\/f-blue] Eve, my brother tore away the old couplets and pasted new couplets in the wall between my house gate."],["In the couplets were written some greetings. It is said that the couplets can bring good luck to the whole families."],["After dinner, we usually watch a TV program named Spring Festival Gala Evening, which is made and [f-blue]broadcast[\/f-blue] by CCTV. Most Chinese people  watch that each year."],["But I thought it was just [f-blue]a[\/f-blue]verage this year."],[],[],["But the form of the program is similar each year, they have the performances of singing and dancing and [f-red]opusculum[\/f-red], magic show appears in recent years.(Opusculum is a real word, but I don't think most people know what it means. \"Short stories\" or \"songs\" might make more sense, depending on who you're talking to.)"],[],["I live in a county [f-red]in which[\/f-red] there [f-blue]are[\/f-blue] no strict rules [sline]about[\/sline] banning setting off firecrackers and fireworks."],[],[],["In my hometown, you can see nobody at the moment because what you can see is the smoke [f-red]that[\/f-red] the firecrackers and fireworks left."],[],["Since the New Year came, [f-red]p[\/f-red]a pa and ma ma were the person who my brother and I asked for red envelopes."],["Though my brother and I are already college students, [sline]but[\/sline] we don't have jobs, so it's still okay to ask[sline]ed[\/sline] adults for red envelopes."],["Some districts in China [f-blue]have[\/f-blue] another custom, if one never get[f-blue]s[\/f-blue] marri[f-blue]ed[\/f-blue], then he can always ask for red envelopes from the people who already married though the person may younger than him:)"],[]
"Dreams never stop.
My teacher ever asked me a quetion, it was a brain twist.
The quetion is: Everyone has a kind of flower in his body, what is it?
I had no idea about it until my teacher told me the answer: tulips.
Why, because everyone has two lips, ha, you must guess it.
Yes, coze two lips have similar pronounciation with tulips.
When it comes to tulips, there is a country we must talk about: Netherlands--the kingdom of tulips.
Actually.
there are thousands of kinds of flowers, not only tulips, are produced in Netherland and exported to many countries to decorate the world.
Apart from flowers, Nehterlands has many things we can talk about.
Like Amsterdam and it's canals.
If you have chance to go to or live in Amsterdam, you may find canals everywhere.
Think the scene like this: you walk on Amsterdam's street one day and hear the sound of water goes by you, see the doves stroll in the square, feel the sun light blankets on you.
Or just take a seat  in the coffee shop which lays on  the road side near the river, order a cup of latte, think of the truth of life, or maybe, think nothing at all, just enjoy the life, enjoy the air of freedom.
In China, the life style like this  also exists.
In Zhejiang or Jiangsu province, there are many ancient towns, you can find river and boats in the towns as well as quiet and peace.
In ancient China there was one of the most important poets named Sushi or some may call him Su dongpo who wrote a poem about such life: Enjoy the wind breezes through the river, enjoy the moon hangs between the mountains.
At that time, Sushi was drinking and singing with his friends on the river, but he found the most valuable thing in the world--all kinds of things nature offers to our humanbeings.
I am always dreamming of going to the Europe, to see the sun rises in the Aegean Sea, to make a wish in Prague Square, to come across a lover in Avenue des Champs Elysees, to kiss goodbye him in the The Waterloo Bridge.
Life is just only one time, I want to fullfil my life, so I should follow my heart.
My steps never stop coze my dreams never end.
What about you, my dear friends?"],[[],["My teacher[f-red] [\/f-red][f-red]ever [\/f-red]asked me a quetion, it was a [f-blue]brain twist[\/f-blue]. ---> My teacher [f-bold]once [\/f-bold]asked me a question. It was a riddle. \/\/\/\/[f-bold]'[f-blue]Riddle[\/f-blue]' is more natural than 'brain twist[f-blue]er[\/f-blue]', but it can be understood.[\/f-bold]"],[],["I had no idea [f-red]about it[\/f-red] until my teacher told me the answer: tulips. ---> I had no idea until my teacher told me the answer: tulips."],[],["Yes, [f-bold][f-blue]coze[\/f-blue][\/f-bold] two lips have similar pronounciation with tulips. --- [f-bold]coze should be [f-blue]because[\/f-blue] or[f-blue]'cause.[\/f-blue] [f-blue]'cause[\/f-blue] is very informal.[\/f-bold] 
I would say.... [f-blue]\"[\/f-blue][f-blue]Two lips\" and \"tulips\" sounds similar.[\/f-blue]"],["I would say... [f-blue]When we talk about tulips, we cannot avoid mentioning the Netherlands - the king of tulips.[\/f-blue]"],[],["there are thousands of kinds of flowers, not only tulips,[f-blue][f-bold] that[\/f-bold][\/f-blue] are produced in [f-bold][f-blue]the[\/f-blue][\/f-bold] Netherland[f-blue][f-bold]s[\/f-bold][\/f-blue] and exported to many countries to decorate the world. [f-bold]\/OR[\/f-bold]\/ there are thousands of kinds of flowers, not only tulips, [f-blue][f-bold]which [\/f-bold][\/f-blue]are produced-- [f-bold]Netherland is said strangely in English. Other countries are not spoken like this.[\/f-bold]
I would say... [f-blue]The Netherlands produces and exports many kinds of flowers including tulips.[\/f-blue] Simpler this way."],["I would say... [f-blue]There are many other things the Netherlands is famous for.[\/f-blue]"],["Like Amsterdam and it[f-red][f-bold]'[\/f-bold][\/f-red]s canals. ---> its canals.[f-bold] ----- The apostrophe (') is only used with it for \"it is.\" The possesive form of it does not use an apostrophe.[\/f-bold]"],["If you have [f-bold][f-blue]a[\/f-blue][\/f-bold] chance to go to or live in Amsterdam, you [f-red]may[\/f-red] find canals everywhere. -- [f-blue]will [\/f-blue]sounds more natural than [f-red]may[\/f-red]. \"[f-blue]a[\/f-blue] chance\" can also be \"[f-blue]the[\/f-blue] chance.\" "],[],[],["In China, the life style like this also exists. ---> In China, this life style also exists. [f-bold]---- Your writing is correct. This just sounds more natural.[\/f-bold]"],[],[],[],["to kiss [f-blue]goodbye him[\/f-blue] in the The Waterloo Bridge. ----> to kiss [f-blue]him goodbye[\/f-blue]"],["[f-bold]Life is just only one time ---> [f-blue]You only live once [\/f-blue][\/f-bold]sounds more natural."],["My steps never stop coze my dreams never end. --- [f-bold]coze should be [f-blue]because[\/f-blue] or [f-blue]'cause.[\/f-blue] [f-blue]'cause[\/f-blue] is very informal.[\/f-bold]"],[]
"stoy muy triste
estoy triste porque el accidente sucedió en Philippines.( I am very sad because the accident happened in Philippines)
En 23 de agosto, un coche que viajaba de Hong-Kong fue secuestrado por un funcionario despedido.
(In August 23, a Hongkong viziting car was kidnapped by a sacked official.)
¡el secuestrador exigió reinstalar su poste y calentó la policía para no venir cerca del autobús!（the hijacker demanded to reinstate his post and warmed the police not to come near the bus!!)
¡o él tiraría a los visitantes!（or he would shoot the visitors!）
pero la policía cueste lo que cueste el visitors' las vidas, ella asintió el coche.(but the police regardless the visitors'lives, they came round the car)
¡mataron al secuestrador bagan tirar, 8 visitantes chinos, 6 dañados!(the hijacker bagan to shoot, 8 chinese visitors were killed,6 injured!)
el comportamiento peor del philippines' ¡la policía era ella tiró las fotos sobre el terreno como si viajaran!!!（the worst behavior of the philippines' police was they shot photos in the spot as if they were traveling!!!）
la falta de rescatar a las víctimas puede demostrar obviamente las inhabilidades del Philippine' ¡la policía de s, y el tirar de las fotos pueden probar fuertemente la carencia de su humanidad!!!
（the failure of rescuing the victims can obviously show the disabilities of the Philippine's police, and the photos shooting can strongly prove the lack of their humanity!!!）
¿incluso el secuestrador acordado para dejar al viajero ir al cuarto de lavado, cómo puede la policía fijada y sonrisa y tomó las fotos en el punto sangriento???
（even the kidnapper agreed to let the traveler to go to the washing room,  how can the police posted and smile and took photos at the bloody spot ???）
How can a nation smile to the deaths?"],[[],["estoy triste [f-blue]por [\/f-blue]el accidente [f-blue]que [\/f-blue]sucedió en Philippines.( I am very sad because the accident happened in Philippines)"],["[f-blue]El [\/f-blue]23 de agosto, un [f-blue]bus [\/f-blue]que [f-blue]venia [\/f-blue]de Hong-Kong fue secuestrado por un funcionario despedido."],[],["¡el secuestrador exigió[f-blue] que lo tomen de nuevo[\/f-blue] y [f-blue]advirtió a[\/f-blue] la policía [f-blue]que no se acerque al[\/f-blue] autobus!（the hijacker demanded to reinstate his post and warmed the police not to come near the bus!!) "],["¡o él [f-blue]le dispararia [\/f-blue]a los visitantes!（or he would shoot the visitors!）"],["pero la policía [f-blue]sin considerar las vidas de los turistas, rodeó [\/f-blue]el coche.(but the police regardless the visitors'lives, they came round the car)"],["[f-blue]El secuestrador empezó a disparar. 8 turistas chinos murieron y 6 fueron heridos.[\/f-blue](the hijacker bagan to shoot, 8 chinese visitors were killed,6 injured!)"],["El peor comportamiento de la policia fue que despues se sacaron fotos como si estuvieran de viaje. （the worst behavior of the philippines' police was they shot photos in the spot as if they were traveling!!!）"],["la[f-blue] falla(el fracaso) al [\/f-blue]rescatar a las víctimas puede demostrar obviamente [f-blue]la [\/f-blue]inhabilidad de la policia y[f-blue] la toma de[\/f-blue] fotos pue[f-blue]de[\/f-blue] probar [f-blue]claramente [\/f-blue]la carencia de [f-blue][\/f-blue]humanidad."],[],["¿incluso el secuestrador [f-blue]dejaba a los viajeros ir al baño[\/f-blue], cómo puede la policía [f-blue]posar y sonreir[\/f-blue] y tomar las fotos en[f-blue] ese luga[\/f-blue]r sangriento???"],[],["¿Como puede una nacion sonreir ante la muerte?"]
"alone in lonely.
I encountered a song today which is called \"alone in lonely\", It's a Chinese song.
The lyrics of this song is about a man who missed his girl, and felt there was nothing left in life without his girl.
And now I'll try to translate the lyrics to you all.
Here is the lyrics.
Each time when I wake up at the edge of missing you,
The darkness of night, please, covers me up
My life now is a cup of water, for  being without you, there is without any taste in my life.
The memory between us has a hundred decibel,
It is so loud and annoying that I can't fall asleep.
Who can let go when he loved head over heels.
You are the person who make me feel disabled in love.
Yes I'm alone alone alone alone in lonely.
So lonely lonely lonely don't wanna go away (This sentence is the original sentence,through grammar, I think it should be \"doesn't wanna go away\" rather than \"don't wanna go away\")
I'm alone alone alone alone in loving you
Though there are so many people in the world, how can I live without you.
Yes I'm alone alone alone alone in lonely.
So lonely lonely lonely don't wanna go away 
I'm alone alone alone alone in loving you
Nostalgic people is the most lonely one, 
and the naive love is the deepest one carved in mind.
No matter who you will love next,
you have to be happy
And I'll never care in your eye it is a hypocritical wishes or not.
Yes I'm alone alone alone alone in lonely.
So lonely lonely lonely don't wanna go away 
I'm alone alone alone alone in loving you
Though there are so many people in the world, how can I live without you.
Yes I'm alone alone alone alone in lonely.
So lonely lonely lonely don't wanna go away 
I'm alone alone alone alone in loving you
Nostalgic people is the most lonely one, 
and the naive love is the deepest one carved in mind.
That's all for the lyrics.
This is the first time I translate lyric, so there is no rhyme at all in my traslation.
hehe.
I have to learn a lot from you.
I like this song because its lyric, Chinese lyrics, of course.
Because I can't translate them well, so I don't think I'll think my english lyrics are something,
My friend ever told me a poem he wrote
\"I missed your childhood, your youth,
The river of life had many occasional turnings,
and went by the wilderness of plain.
Then, I found you.\"
Everytime I say \" I miss you\", I'm aways afraid that I'll lose you someday.
But I have never lost you because I've never seen you, never found you.
Before I see you, I know I should bear a long dark period of loneliness.
So when you show up in frond of me, please bring me a houseful of sunshine at the same time."],[[],["I listen to a song \"alone in lonely\" today. It's a Chinese song."],["The song is about a man who missed his girlfriend, and felt nothing left in his life without her."],[],[],[],[],["My life now is a cup of water, for  being without you, there is no taste in my life."],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],["My friend told me a poem he wrote"],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[]
