"Journal Entry #4: School Cultures
I think that the small group activity-focused teaching method is better than the lecture-focused teaching method.
I think this because you should be able to talk  and ask questions.
You should also be able to communicate with the other students in the class.
If you are not able to talk or communicate how could you more understand the learning method?
Then you could ask the teacher questions."],[[],[],[],[],[],[]
"Spanish Speaking Country
Going to school in a Spanish-speaking country could be different from the English-speaking country that I live in now because we might not understand some of the things that the teachers are saying and at times the teachers may not understand what we are saying to them.
It could be the same because we would still be learning Spanish and still children that are the same age would be in that learning environment.
At the same time it would be a great opportunity for me to go to a Spanish-speaking country just to learn that language."],[[],[],[],[]
