"School Cultures
Students-Teacher relationship
I think that it is better to have an informal relationship.
The advantages of having a informal relationship is that the teacher may be able to work with you because they are more informed about your problems.
The disadvantages are students may get to comfortable with teacher or teacher may get to close to the students"],[[],[],[],[],[]
