I don't know what to write about, so I'll tell you about my cats.
(I feel like a loser, hehehe.)
First, I have a black cat named Sammy.
He's very noisy and afraid of everything.
He sits next to me while I use the computer.
He will cry and cry if I don't play with him.
It's very annoying, but I love him.
My other cat is named Jimmy.
He has grey fur and he loves the outdoors.
He always wants to be outside.
He spends his days sleeping outside and eating.
He's a very boring cat.
The picture is of the two sleeping together on the couch.
They're really cute, right?
:3
Until next time~
