"I have a fortune of eating.
When I was an enfant, my parents ran a supermarket so I was free whenever I want snacks.
After I enter an elementry school my parents change their shop to fried chicken restaurante.
And after a few years, they changed menu to pork cutlet.
And when I'm in a middle school, it was changed to sushi restaurant.
All of my friends envyed me.
And now they run grilled meet restaurante.
I'm not hungry even if I don't have money in a back pack travel time.
It used to somebody treat me.
When I had my fortune told on internet, I was died in early age because of hunger in my previous life.
I guess that's why I always have a good fortune of eating."],[[],["When I was an infant, I was able to eat snacks whenever I wanted because my parents ran a supermarket."],["After I entered elementary school, my parents switched from running a supermarket to owning a fried chicken restaurant."],["A few years after that, they changed the menu to pork cutlets."],[],["All of my friends [f-red]envyed[\/f-red] [f-blue]envied[\/f-blue] me."],["Now they run a grilled meat restaurant."],[],[],["When I had my fortune told over the internet, it informed that I had died of hunger at an early age in my previous life."],[]
