"Occupation which I want to become in the future
It's Orthoptist.
Do you know it?
Maybe the occupation is not famous.
I will discribe the occuoation a little.
We work at Ophthalmology department.
We inspect the visual acuity testing and view.
And we do the prescription of glasses and the prescription of the contact lens.
Besides, we train for the correction of the child of the weak sight and the squint too.
It is challenging very work.
I am enjoying this study very much.
Studying is very interesting!!"],[[],[],[],["Maybe the occupation isn't famous."],["I'll discribe the occupation a little."],["We work at [f-blue]the[\/f-blue] Ophthalmology department."],[],[],["Besides, we train\/work for the correction of the child's weak sight and the squint too."],["It's a very challenging work."],["I enjoy studying this very much."],[]
