"Emo?
I used an online translator for these and I am hoping it did the translation correctly.
:D
English: My love for you is forbidden by nature and by our Lord, God.
You don't even love me, am I right?
But tell me why?
Why can't I stop loving you?
Spanish: Mi amor para usted es prohibido por la naturaleza y por nuestro señor, dios.
¿Usted incluso no me amo, tengo razón?
¿Pero dígame porqué?
¿Por qué no puedo parar el amar de usted?
french: Notre seigneur, Dieu interdit mon amour pour toi par la nature et.
Est-ce que vous, je ne m'aime pas même ai raison ?
Mais dites-moi pourquoi ?
Pourquoi est-ce que je ne peux pas cesser de vous aimer ?
And oh, can you help me with the Japanese and German translation as well.
^w^
arrrghhh...
Btw, where can I find a site where the pronunciation for the text\/ sentences are available as well?
