Ben"],[[],[],[],["[f-red]Soy[\/f-red] un estudiante de York University y [f-blue](yo)[\/f-blue] estoy estudiando Estudios Ambiental[f-bold]es[\/f-bold]. [f-blue](Since[\/f-blue][f-blue] you are already talking about yourself in the beginning of the sentence, you dont need to add \"yo\" when you are going to add aditional information about yourself. In this case, not adding\"yo\" makes the sentenceflow better.)[\/f-blue]"],["Yo quiero aprend[f-bold]e[\/f-bold]r español para [f-blue]viajar[\/f-blue] y hablar con mis amigos."],[],[],[]
"ha sido mucho tiempo desde la ultima visita
