"escribir sobre mí mismo
Me llamo Wojtek.
Tengo veintidos ańos.
Yo Vivo en Poznań.
Mi madre se llama Bożena, es maestra en la escuela.
Mi padre se llama Krzysztof y trabaja en el ejército.
Mi hermano se llama Tomek, vive en Poznań y es de salvavidas.
Trabaja en la piscina.
Es alto y delgado.
Es tiene veintiseis ańos.
Yo Tengo el pelo corto y moreno.
Tengo los ojos azules.
Soy delgado.
Tengo ciento ochenta centimetros.
Hoy tengo la camiseta blanca, los pantalones azules, los zapatos negros.
Me gusta monopatin, snowboard y ordenador.
Tengo el mayor sitio web sobre de los desportes extremos en Polonia.
Vento de las camisetas, los boligrafos con el logotipo y juego de telefono.
Me gusta escuchar la musica.
Me gusta sopa de tomate, pollo y patatas fritas.
Me no gusta aburrido.
Me gustan leer libros.
Mi color favorito es el azule."],[[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[]
"Just another day....
But not so much normal....
Well, at first it was \"normal\" Until my step-dad got the idea of re-arranging the house a bit.
Switching to Living room with some other room with all the computers in it.
[it was a last minute room that the owner made by taking out the garage]
I must say, it was a good idea, there seems to be more room now.
And!
I get to sit by the window when I'm on the computer.
That means: Fresh air!
= w =
So I'm glad that today wasn't so \"normal\" after all, since after a while I do get bored of my usual lifestyle.
Get up, eat breakfast [if I'm hungry], do some of my chores, take a shower, go on the computer until I get bored, do some more chores after dinner, then go on the computer again and try to amuse myself.....
Which my amusement to night is Anime!!!!
;3
Soooo, that's all for now!
bye-bye!
<3
P.
S.
The picture I put on there is from...
lets see....
Last year?
maybe, it's old, and I drew it with a pencil and printer paper.
:D I see so many flaws, but it's still a good picture!"],[[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[]
