"Hello! (^-^)
Well, out of my boredom I search for something to do over summer.
And since I'm rarely let out of the house, I decided to look for a blog site.
Thanks to a manga I was reading [ Koko Ni Iru Yo!
] That gave me the idea.....
(^-^);
Then the thought of blogging on a site with all types of people [not just american ] just to learn how life is with them as well.
:D
But anywho, I'm debating on going to bed [since it's almost twelve in the morning...
] or stay up and do random things online.......
*ponders*
Oh!
I'm going to go see the new Transformers Movie tomorrow too!
(OwO)
I can't wait!
I've heard that it was awesome, but I'll have to see for myself!
;3
- - -
The picture that's on this post is one I made earlier today.
(>w< ) Isn't she adorable?
I made her with MS Paint.
She's my RPC.
Masha.
A neko thanks to my obsession with anime\/manga, etc....
Hope everyone likes it!
<3 
But that's all for now!
Since I have things to do on other sites.
bye~"],[[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[]
