"Unas preguntas
1.
Es verdadero.
De verdad.
Verdad.
De veras.
¿Son todas estas frases iguales?
2.
¡Alto, Alto!
¿A qué viene eso?
¿Qué significan estas?
3.
Cuando entré la habitación, Juan estaba escribiendo
Cuando entré la habitación, Juan escribía
¿Cual es la diferencia entre estas dos frases?
4.
¡Fuera de aquí!
significa \"Get out of here!\" \"出て行け！
\"?
5.
No me digas.
tambien significa \"estoy totalmente de acuerdo\"?
Muchas Gracias"],[[],[],["Es verdadero. will be something like [f-blue]\"that's true\"[\/f-blue]"],["De verdad. will be [f-blue]\"really?\"[\/f-blue]"],["Verdad. When you use this word at the end of a sentenece means that you want a confirmation for example El carro es rojo ¿verdad? tha will be [f-blue]\"The car is red, isn't it?\"[\/f-blue] *NOTE: we mexicans also use \"eda\" instead of \"verdad\" we make the word shorter \"[sline]v[\/sline]e[sline]r[\/sline]da[sline]d[\/sline]\""],["[f-red]De veras[\/f-red] and [f-blue]de verdad [\/f-blue]is exactly the same but the second sounds more formal."],[],[],[],[],[],[],["Cuando entré [f-red]en[\/f-red] la habitación, Juan estaba escribiendo"],["Cuando entré [f-red]en [\/f-red]la habitación, Juan escribía"],["The conjuction of the verb, but the meaning is the same altough the second sounds more like it was a poem."],[],[],["Exactly, we also use the word [f-blue]\"largáte\"[\/f-blue] that means the same as [f-blue]\"fuera de aquí\"[\/f-blue]"],[],[],["No me digas. This also is a little tricky one, because depending in the tone of your voice it can mean that you're interested in the topicfor exmple: Did you know that Teresa is pregnant? [f-blue]Really? (Tell me more) [\/f-blue]in japanese will be [f-blue]ぞうですか[\/f-blue]. But in the other hand we have the other meaning tha denotes sarcasm, and will be like [f-red]\"really, I already know you idiot\"[\/f-red]"],["tambien significa \"estoy totalmente de acuerdo\"? No, the meanings of \"no me digas\" are the ones I had put up there, an also like [f-blue]\"don't tell me\"[\/f-blue] for example [f-blue]\"Guess what I Bought you? I bought you a.....wait don't tell me\"[\/f-blue] that in spanish will be [f-blue]\"¿Adivina que te compré? Te compre un ...... espera, no me digas\"[\/f-blue]"],[]
