In English:
Hi,
I hope that I have enough energy to finish this entry...
I could say that I have swallowed a cheese grater or a hedgehog....
not no, I just have my period--which many of you would know about.
WOMENNN
I AM IN PAIN greater than my body
hahaha
Maybe, first, I need to introduce myself.
My name is Victoria and I'm from California
I want to be an adult someday...
but I am not close to this.
I would like to be fluent in Spanish (by the way, I don't know how to make a 'tilde' above the n) because I love to travel in spanish-speaking countries (mexico, spain, peru, chile) and, secondly, I need to learn for my job (I work in an ophthalmology laboratory and we travel to mexico often)
Thank you for reading this, I welcome all corrections.
I would like it if you would be able to help me make my Spanish more natural...
and correct, obviously.
thanks thank thanks
