\"¿Está bien de sal?\"
I begin to confuse about a part of \"de sal\".
\"Sopa\" has an article, but \"sal\" doesn't have one in those samples.
Is it correct to write \"¿Está bien la sal?\" or \"¿Está bien del sal?\" ?
Doese they have any differences?
Please teach me about them.
