"What's going on with Lang-8? 
Opinion
-----------
Ok, I love this site, because it innovative, creative and shows what the Japanese do best.
Wonders
-----------
I've arrived on this website not long ago, and I really wasn't that impressed with the layout.
It made me wonder...
I look at the top line that says: \"LET'S GET A FREE PREMIUM ACCOUNT!\" and I'm thinking WTF?
Is this a serious website?
Why did they start a freakin' countdown for these accounts, that don't really offer anything of significance in terms of features??
The Suspicion Grows On
----------------------------------
After a bit of research, the Signs began to unveil: 
It's pretty clear, I found this website to be quite old, at least 3 years active
Some other signs were: the very Low Tech Logo for the website that was adopted by the company (I don't have a picture, sorry).
Also, after watching the official Presentation, according to one of the responses (I haven't understood anything since it was in Japanese)  the number of users\/customers was to reach Millions in Japan, but barely made it to a mere 100,000 worldwide.
Another response was:
\"I bought the premium account to donate to the owners of this site, it's the least I can do in their state\" Something like that..
The Pessimistic Conclusion
-----------------------------------------
So, to sum things up, all of these signs gave me the impression
that this site is going down - Fast, and that I have registered just in time to witness it's rapid demise...:("],[[],[],[],["Ok, I love this site, because it[f-blue]'s[\/f-blue] innovative, creative and shows what the Japanese do best."],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[]
