Pero cuando[f-blue] llueve[\/f-blue],[f-blue] la gente no entra[\/f-blue] [f-blue]en[\/f-blue] los neg[f-blue]ocios[\/f-blue] a hacer la compra.[f-blue] <this is my version :-) : \"cuando llueve\" = \"when it rains\"; \"la gente no entra...\" = \"people don't go in...\" ; \"a hacer la compra\" = \"to buy things\"; \"to do shopping\">[\/f-blue]"]
