"Fui a Famarcia
Finally tonight I went to the pharmacy to buy medicines as my abdomen keeps painful.
The boss of the pharmacy said that recently many people had such illness like me.
Maybe the water is not clean.
The water in my state is really not good.
It is not clean.
You can see there is mud and other insects.
And sometimes the water supply will stop.
What is poor country.
I don't know how people can tolerate.
Maybe they have never experienced a good living environement so that never fight for it.
I hope oneday this country will be as good as that of Tokyo.
Finalmente fui a famarcia esta noche para comprar los medicinas como mi abdomen continue doloroso.
La jefa de famarcia dijiste que recientemente muchas personas tuvieron semejante enfermedad come yo.
Tal vez el agua no es limpio.
El agua en mi ciudad no es buenisimo.
Es no limpio.
Puedes ver que hay lodo y otros insectos.
Y a veces el agua suministro parar.
Que país pobre.
No sé come la gente puede soportar.
Tal vez ellos nunca ha experimentado un environment de vida buneno asi que nunca luchar por este.
Espero una día este país puede buenas come el Tokyo."],[[],["Finally tonight I went to the pharmacy to buy medicines as my abdomen [f-blue]is still hurting[\/f-blue]."],["The [f-blue]pharmacist[\/f-blue] said that recently many people had [f-blue]a similar illness[\/f-blue]."],[],[],[],[],[],["[f-red]It[\/f-red] is [f-red]a[\/f-red] poor country."],["I don't know how people can tolerate [f-red]it[\/f-red]."],["Maybe they have never experienced a good living environement so that [f-blue]they will[\/f-blue] never fight for it."],["I hope one[f-red]_[\/f-red]day this country will be as good as that of Tokyo."],["Finalmente fui a [f-red]la[\/f-red] famarcia esta noche para comprar [sline]los[\/sline] medicinas [f-red]porque[\/f-red] mi abdomen [f-blue]sigue[\/f-blue] doloroso. [f-blue]<Opción: porque todavía me duele el estómago>[\/f-blue]
