"\"Smiley\"
Actually, I didn't know how to read smileys or \"kaomoji\" when they were written in Western languages.
In Japanese way, we write smileys vertically.
Do you understand what I mean???
I mean, the \"face\" of smiley is standing(?) in the same direction as me.
But in Western way, it is lying.
I didn't know that a few months ago so I sometimes couldn't understand what smileys in e-mails from my foreign friends meant.
Now I guess I can \"decipher\" them.
Though I can't write them all by myself.
It's a littele difficult, isn't it?
And...
honestly, I have to tilt myface almost horizontal when I \"decipher\" smileys.
I'm a little ashamed of it...
I think I have not undergone enough training yet."],[[],[],["In [f-blue]the [\/f-blue]Japanese way, we write smileys vertically."],[],["I mean, the \"face\" of [f-blue]the [\/f-blue]smiley is [sline]standing(?)[\/sline] [f-blue]oriented [\/f-blue]in the same direction as [sline]me[\/sline] [f-blue]my own[\/f-blue]."],["But in [f-blue]the [\/f-blue]Western way, it is lying [f-blue]sideways[\/f-blue]."],["I didn't know that a few months ago[f-blue],[\/f-blue] so I sometimes couldn't understand what smileys in e-mails from my foreign friends meant."],["Now[f-blue],[\/f-blue] I guess I can \"decipher\" them."],["[f-blue]Alt[\/f-blue]hough[f-blue],[\/f-blue] I can't write them all by myself."],["It's a l[f-blue]ittle[\/f-blue] difficult, isn't it?"],[],["[f-blue]H[\/f-blue]onestly, I have to tilt my face almost horizontal when I \"decipher\" smileys."],[],["I think I have not undergone enough training yet.([f-red]This is perfectly fine, but it sounds more natural if you say...[f-red][\/f-red][\/f-red])[f-blue]I think I haven't received enough training yet.[\/f-blue][f-red][f-red][\/f-red][\/f-red]"]
"Fiebre
Mi hijo habia tenido fiebre antes de ayer y ayer.
Creo que estaba cansada para el viaje (el fin de agosto) y la visita de su aberos(la semana pasada).
Hoy está bien y va al kindergarten.
Creí que mi hija tendrá fiebre despues de él.
Pero, ella está muy bien.
Em cambio, ahora no estoy bien.
Tengo frío y un poco fiebre.
Tengo que trabajar esta tarde, así, quiero un poco dormir posteriores a escribir eso.
